     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two sets of numbers",
     "texto": [
      "Korean has **two** sets of numbers. The ones of **Chinese origin** (일, 이, 삼…) are used for phone numbers, dates, money, minutes, floors and bus numbers. The **native Korean** ones (하나, 둘, 셋…) are used for counting things, for age and for hours.",
      "Today we cover the first set. The second set comes in the next lesson."
     ],
